abstract: >-
  Code, results and aggregate data of a pre-specified link-unit-month analysis of local heat, rainfall deficit and
  El Niño in pregnancy and reported stillbirths and low birth weight in India, from routine Health Management
  Information System (HMIS) reports linked to stable district units, April 2012 to February 2020. The release panel
  has small counts suppressed; raw HMIS files, FY2020-21 values and district-level values are not included.
